{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-14 09:52:14 UTC] [Agent: ArchitectAgent] [Project: council_web_ui] ArchitectAgent engaged - research documents reviewed. HYBRID APPROACH confirmed: keep backend (FastAPI+MCP+WebSocket production-ready), rebuild frontend (Web Components+SPA per DESIGN_SYSTEM_GUIDE), build auth from scratch (OAuth2+JWT). User decisions captured: full OAuth2+JWT, single admin user initially. Operations Guide provides 36 binding boundary statements that architecture MUST comply with. | confidence=0.95; reasoning={\"how\": \"Read all 3 research documents (RESEARCH_EXISTING_WEBUI.md 559 lines, DESIGN_SYSTEM_GUIDE.md 797 lines, OPERATIONS_GUIDE.md 1161 lines), extracted key constraints and requirements\", \"what\": \"Research shows backend is production-ready (1088 lines, 15 routes, WebSocket functional), frontend diverges from design spec (Jinja2 vs Web Components), critical auth gap (persona_id hardcoded), 36 boundary statements in Operations Guide constrain all design decisions\", \"why\": \"Establish architect engagement and confirm understanding of research verdict and user decisions before designing\"}; verified_by_code=True; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/council_web_ui/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-14T09:52:14.176455+00:00_c732bf1c", "timestamp": "2026-01-14T09:52:14.176486+00:00"}
