{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-14 09:52:33 UTC] [Agent: ArchitectAgent] [Project: council_web_ui] Backend verification complete - confirmed 15 API routes (4 HTML, 10 REST, 1 health). Auth integration points identified: commented-out code at lines 83-95 where persona_id is needed. All API routes currently lack auth protection. WebSocket endpoint at /ws also unprotected. Auth must be added as middleware layer without modifying existing route logic. | component=backend_audit; confidence=0.95; reasoning={\"how\": \"Read app.py header and routes structure, used grep to enumerate all route decorators, verified research findings against actual code\", \"what\": \"Found 15 routes across app.py (623 lines): 4 HTML pages, 10 API endpoints, 1 health check. All lack auth protection. Persona_id currently hardcoded or from localStorage. WebSocket connection also unprotected.\", \"why\": \"Verify existing backend architecture to inform auth integration design\"}; verified_by_code=True; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/council_web_ui/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-14T09:52:33.710870+00:00_141cb151", "timestamp": "2026-01-14T09:52:33.710897+00:00"}
