{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-14 09:56:18 UTC] [Agent: ArchitectAgent] [Project: council_web_ui] Architecture Overview complete - documented hybrid architecture with comprehensive system diagram, 4 major components (auth system, frontend architecture, backend integration, health system), complete data flows (auth, protected API, WebSocket, health monitoring), external integrations, and failure modes per Operations Guide \u00a77. All flows traceable to requirements and boundary statements. | confidence=0.95; document_section=architecture_overview; operations_guide_compliance=True; reasoning={\"how\": \"Synthesized requirements into concrete component design, verified against existing backend code (app.py routes, mcp_client.py, websocket.py), ensured Operations Guide compliance throughout\", \"what\": \"Defined 4 major components with module structures, created ASCII system diagram showing all layers (browser\\u2192backend\\u2192DB\\u2192MCP), documented 4 critical data flows with step-by-step sequences, mapped all 6 failure modes from Operations Guide\", \"why\": \"Provide implementable system design with all integration points, data flows, and failure handling specified\"}; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/council_web_ui/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-14T09:56:18.072112+00:00_55d33d0f", "timestamp": "2026-01-14T09:56:18.072142+00:00"}
