{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-14 09:58:47 UTC] [Agent: ArchitectAgent] [Project: council_web_ui] Phase Plan complete - documented 5 phases (Phase 0: Auth BLOCKER, Phase 1: Frontend Foundation, Phase 2: Page Migration, Phase 3: Health & Operations, Phase 4: Testing). Total 22-29 days effort. Created 19 task packages with specifications, verification criteria, file lists, and dependencies. Each phase has deliverables and acceptance criteria. Critical path: Phase 0 blocks all frontend work. | confidence=0.95; document=PHASE_PLAN.md; phases=5; reasoning={\"how\": \"Analyzed architecture components, mapped to implementation phases, broke each phase into small task packages (1-3 files each), specified verification criteria per Operations Guide, documented dependencies to prevent parallel work on dependent tasks\", \"what\": \"Broke rebuild into 5 phases, 19 task packages, each with file lists, specifications, verification steps, dependencies. Phase 0 (auth) has 5 tasks, Phase 1 (frontend) has 5 tasks, Phase 2 (pages) has 4 tasks, Phase 3 (operations) has 3 tasks, Phase 4 (testing) has 4 tasks.\", \"why\": \"Provide Coder Agent with executable, scoped task packages that prevent scope creep and ensure systematic implementation\"}; task_packages=19; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/council_web_ui/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-14T09:58:47.630503+00:00_a8cbc041", "timestamp": "2026-01-14T09:58:47.630537+00:00"}
