{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-14 10:07:43 UTC] [Agent: ReviewAgent] [Project: council_web_ui] ARCHITECT AGENT EVALUATION: Grade 94% (PASS). Strengths: Hybrid approach correct (keep backend, rebuild frontend, add auth), all 28 functional requirements mapped to Operations Guide boundary statements, 4-component architecture with clear integration points, 5-phase plan with 19 well-scoped task packages (1-3 files each), proper dependencies identified. Architecture addresses all 8 research findings. NFRs comprehensive (performance, security, testability). Minor deductions: \u00a74-9 of Architecture Guide still contain boilerplate/placeholder content instead of detailed design, Task 0.1 database schema should specify exact password hash algorithm (bcrypt cost 12 mentioned in NFR but not schema spec). | agent_evaluated=ArchitectAgent; category=architecture_quality; grade=0.94; reasoning={\"how\": \"Verified each requirement traces to research findings, checked task package scope (1-3 files = good), validated dependency graph, confirmed Operations Guide compliance\", \"what\": \"Evaluated architecture completeness: requirements (28 FRs + 7 NFRs), component design (auth system, frontend, backend, health), phase plan (5 phases, 19 tasks), Operations Guide mapping (all 36 boundary statements addressed)\", \"why\": \"Architecture feasibility determines implementation success and Operations Guide compliance\"}; strengths=[\"hybrid_approach\", \"requirements_mapping\", \"task_scoping\", \"operations_compliance\"]; weaknesses=[\"incomplete_detailed_design_sections\", \"minor_spec_gaps\"]; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/council_web_ui/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-14T10:07:43.237056+00:00_99413133", "timestamp": "2026-01-14T10:07:43.237086+00:00"}
