{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-14 10:08:30 UTC] [Agent: ReviewAgent] [Project: council_web_ui] GAP ANALYSIS: Minor gaps identified - (1) Architecture Guide \u00a74-9 contain placeholder content instead of detailed component design (not blocking for Phase 0 start), (2) No explicit verification that passlib[bcrypt] and python-jose are in requirements.txt (should check before implementation), (3) WebSocket token via query param logs token in server logs (suggest header-based alternative in review), (4) Database migration strategy mentioned but no Alembic version control verification. RECOMMENDATION: These are minor polish issues, not blockers. Architecture is ready for implementation with small refinements during Phase 0. | blocking_gaps=0; evaluation_type=gap_analysis; gaps_found=4; reasoning={\"how\": \"Reviewed architecture sections for completeness, checked task specifications for dependency lists, validated data flows for completeness\", \"what\": \"Searched for incomplete sections, missing dependencies, unspecified behaviors, integration risks\", \"why\": \"Gap analysis identifies missing pieces that could block implementation\"}; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/council_web_ui/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-14T10:08:30.665519+00:00_aae7f769", "timestamp": "2026-01-14T10:08:30.665555+00:00"}
