{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-14 10:15:54 UTC] [Agent: Atlas] [Project: council_web_ui] CRITICAL RESEARCH UPDATE: AgentKit already has complete user auth system! Found agentkit.auth module with: AccountRecord, SessionRecord, create_user(), authenticate_user(), create_session(), fetch_session(), revoke_session(), seed_roles(), assign_role(). Uses bcrypt for password hashing, session tokens with SHA256 hash storage. DB tables: users, user_sessions, roles, user_roles. HOWEVER: No user\u2192persona mapping exists - persona_profiles uses string slugs with no FK to users table. Need to add junction table or owner_user_id column. | finding=agentkit_auth_exists; gap=user_persona_mapping; phase=research_update; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/council_web_ui/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-14T10:15:54.348818+00:00_a98c051e", "timestamp": "2026-01-14T10:15:54.348845+00:00"}
