{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-14 21:09:20 UTC] [Agent: ReviewAgent] [Project: council_web_ui] \u2705 PHASE 2 VERIFICATION COMPLETE - Page Migration: All 4 pages successfully migrated to Web Components (Dashboard: 337 lines, Sessions: 375 lines, Memories: 428 lines, Audit: 460 lines). All pages extend BaseComponent, use Shadow DOM, implement WebSocket subscriptions for real-time updates. Data components created (card-stat: 145 lines, card-memory: 284 lines, table-data: 218 lines, badge-status: 123 lines). Modal-base and btn-action components present. Index.html properly registers all 5 routes. Total Phase 2 output: 2621 lines across 9 files. All acceptance criteria met. | components_created=7; pages_migrated=4; phase=2; total_lines=2621; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/council_web_ui/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-14T21:09:20.417482+00:00_2225e9c4", "timestamp": "2026-01-14T21:09:20.417510+00:00"}
