{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-14 21:09:39 UTC] [Agent: ReviewAgent] [Project: council_web_ui] \ud83d\udd0d SECURITY AUDIT PHASE 0-2: Verified WebSocket authentication at line 546-579 in app.py. WebSocket requires token query parameter, validates using fetch_session(), closes with 4001 on missing/invalid/revoked tokens. All protected API routes have Depends(get_current_user) dependency (lines 77, 172, 238, 282, 316, 337, etc). Auth routes properly wrap AgentKit functions. No hardcoded secrets found. Bearer token format enforced. Session revocation supported. Password hashing delegated to AgentKit (bcrypt cost 12+). | auth_coverage=100%; security_audit=passed; vulnerabilities_found=0; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/council_web_ui/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-14T21:09:39.641751+00:00_866eb6b6", "timestamp": "2026-01-14T21:09:39.641775+00:00"}
