{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-15 01:01:56 UTC] [Agent: Atlas] [Project: council_web_ui] FRONTEND POLISH AUDIT - Initial Assessment Complete. Current state: tokens.css has solid foundation with cyan palette, bg hierarchy, spacing scale. base.css has proper typography, form inputs, buttons. main.css has scrollbar styling, animations, focus states. Components reviewed: page-login (good base), nav-rail (functional), card-stat (needs hover polish), btn-action (working), modal-base (good animations), health-indicator (excellent pulsing states), badge-status (solid), table-data (functional), card-memory (beautiful hover effects). IDENTIFIED IMPROVEMENTS: 1) Login card needs subtle glow effect, 2) Nav-rail needs active link glow, 3) Cards need consistent shadow depth, 4) Buttons need focus glow states, 5) Empty states need visual treatment, 6) Loading states need skeleton screens, 7) Add cybernetic grid background to login. | phase=frontend_polish; reasoning={\"how\": \"Systematic file reading, pattern analysis, aesthetic evaluation against mission control design vision\", \"what\": \"Reviewed 4 CSS files, 10+ component files; identified 7 key improvement areas while maintaining design system consistency\", \"why\": \"Conduct comprehensive audit of existing CSS and components to identify polish opportunities without breaking functionality\"}; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/council_web_ui/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-15T01:01:56.804612+00:00_4cd44608", "timestamp": "2026-01-15T01:01:56.804643+00:00"}
