{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-15 01:07:01 UTC] [Agent: Atlas] [Project: council_web_ui] FRONTEND POLISH COMPLETE - Comprehensive visual enhancement of Council Command Center. Changes: 1) tokens.css: Added --cyan-900, --cyan-glow-strong, --cyan-glow-intense, --shadow-cyan-*, --shadow-card-*, --gradient-cyan, --gradient-surface, --gradient-void, --focus-ring tokens. 2) page-login.js: Cybernetic grid background, radial glow effect, animated card entry, logo with gradient background, input focus glow, error shake animation, button shimmer effect. 3) nav-rail.js: Logo with brand styling, active link indicator bar with glow, gradient overlay, improved logout button. 4) card-stat.js: Dynamic status-based styling, gradient overlay on hover, icon glow effects, shadow depth improvements. 5) btn-action.js: Shimmer hover effect, focus-visible glow states, active press feedback. 6) base.css: Enhanced primary/secondary/danger buttons with gradients, hover transforms, focus rings. 7) main.css: Empty state styling, skeleton loading animations, slide-up/fade-in animations, staggered li... | files_modified=[\"tokens.css\", \"base.css\", \"main.css\", \"page-login.js\", \"nav-rail.js\", \"card-stat.js\", \"btn-action.js\", \"page-dashboard.js\"]; phase=frontend_polish; reasoning={\"how\": \"Systematic enhancement of each layer: tokens first for foundation, then global CSS, then component-specific styles, always using CSS custom properties for maintainability\", \"what\": \"Added glow effects, gradients, animations, consistent shadows, focus states, empty/loading treatments while preserving all functionality and using design tokens\", \"why\": \"Make Command Center visually stunning with professional mission control aesthetic, enhancing user trust and experience\"}; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/council_web_ui/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-15T01:07:01.831151+00:00_6275ed0a", "timestamp": "2026-01-15T01:07:01.831188+00:00"}
